    <ul>
      <li><strong>Shaping:</strong> Tool moves (ram), work feeds sideways. Used for smaller parts.</li>
      <li><strong>Planing:</strong> Work moves (table), tool feeds across. Used for massive parts.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Both use a <strong>quick return</strong> mechanism to minimize idle time on the non-cutting stroke.</p>
